! just need to find the correct show platform command(s)
! this lists the IF_ID of those interfaces in hex
sh platform software fed switch 1 ifm mappings  
! this lists the if_id in decimal, plus displays the if_id of the internal port-channels
sh platform software fed switch active port summary 
! this command will confirm with the ContextName that you have the correct if_id ( if_id 53 is HundredGigE0/49 on one of my switches )
sh platform hardware fed switch active ethernet-controller port-info 53
! this command displays what looks like interface controller counters
sh platform hardware fed switch active ethernet-controller link-status 53
